[Q4] 新严格链
   L1 [T] phi(w)=sin u/u, u=arccos(1-w); phi(0)=1, phi(2)=0, phi 严格递减
   L2 [T] P(w>t) <= e^{-Bt}   (只用 phi 递减; 常数 C1 = 1, 不是 1.582)
   L3 [T] E[w^k] = k*int t^{k-1}P(w>t)dt <= k!/B^k  => Var(w)<=E[w^2]<=2/B^2
   L4 [T] Var(h) = min_c E[(h-c)^2]  (任意常数 c 都可)
   L5 [T] 取 c=Wlo/3, Delta=w-Wlo: E[Delta^2]=E[w^2]-2WloE[w]+Wlo^2 <= E2-Wlo^2
   L6 [T] h=w/3+e,  e<=w^2/45+0.06w^3 (数值核验)
          => Var(h) <= (E2-Wlo^2)/9 + (2/3)[E[w^3]/45+0.06E[w^4]]
                        + 0.01185/B^4+0.1654/B^5+0.6918/B^6
   L7 [T] phi <= 1-w/3  =>  E[w^k] <= [int_0^2 w^k(1-w/3)e^{-Bw}]/Zlb
          Zlb = int_0^1(1-w/3-w^2/45-w^3/189)e^{-Bw} + phi(1)*int_1^2(2-w)e^{-Bw}
          (phi 在 [1,2] 凹 => phi >= 弦 phi(1)(2-w);  phi(1)=2/pi)
   L8 [T] E[w] >= Wlo=(1-r)/B, r=Kbar/Zlb, Kbar=M*int_0^1we^{-Bw}+sum e^{-Ba_k}int w|phi'|
          M=pi/6 全 [T]; M=0.406 需数值认证 [C] (实测 max on [0,1] = 0.405285)

